    "titleText": {
      "es": "Cuando te miro a los ojos, veo artefactos JPEG. Por los píxeles puedo saber que no estamos hechos el uno para el otro.",
      "en": "When I look into your eyes, I see JPEG artifacts. I can tell by the pixels that we're wrong for each other.",
      "noteEn": "The title text treats JPEG artifacts and visible pixels as mock evidence that the two people are wrong for each other."
